window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p></p><p><b>One of America’s iconic thriller heroes recruits </b><b>his lasting love, Margo Lane, and his great-great-granddaughter, Maddy Gomes, to join an international investigation. </b> </p><p> For over 150 years, Lamont Cranston, and his alter ego, The Shadow, has possessed an array of mental and physical powers: scientific skills, shape-shifting ability, and mind control.<br> When a series of deadly natural disasters strike the planet, immediately set out to identify who’s responsible…<br> A disgruntled graduate student? The power-hungry president of the Americas? Or could it be Shiwan Khan, the Shadow’s fiercest enemy?<br> The Shadow’s latest adventure is also his, Maddy’s, and Margo’s most dangerous. Triumph or perish, they’ll rise or fall...together. </p>"; 
